{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24085","headline":"犬鸢 · 白居易","name":"犬鸢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚来天气好，散步中门前。\n门前何所有，偶覩犬与鸢。\n鸢饱凌风飞，犬暖向日眠。\n腹舒稳贴地，翅凝高摩天。\n上无罗弋忧，下无羁锁牵。\n见彼物遂性，我亦心适然。\n心适复何爲，一咏逍遥篇。\n此仍着於适，尚未能忘言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}